al Q bits appear at J6." (at 20.32 393.7 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 81f4c91a-e38c-58b5-8c76-a21399f0f059))(text "QUIET_SAFE and candidate data must meet physical setup/hold. Gate delay, asynchronous clear, metastability and clock-integrity qualification remain." (at 20.32 401.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 65fec4cf-6782-51a9-8ba1-e10fbda27645)))
